{
  "about": "The Navigation window's route view and small form. On Morroc's road with the window open, /navi morocc 160/135 turns it to the route view: the map's picture with the trail's dots, a mark where it ends and the player's mark, the map's name, where it heads (\"morocc 160 135\") and \"[Destination] -> morocc 160 135\". The view button turns to the search view and back. The title's minimize button makes the small form (134 x 61, see-through) that says the same two places; its maximize button brings the window back. With the \"Minimize\" box ticked, a click on the ground makes it small again. Esc asks to cancel; after that the window is in its search view.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "steps": [
    {"say": "@warp morocc 160 120"},
    {"settle": 1500},
    {"say": "/naviopen"},
    {"wait": 400},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.route": false, "navi_window.mini": false}}},
    {"say": "/navi morocc 160/135"},
    {"wait": 600},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.route": true, "navigation.cell": [160, 135]}, "no_target": {"button": "navi_find"}}},
    {"move": [1000, 740]},
    {"shot": "navi-route-view", "crop": [366, 205, 292, 358], "threshold": 2},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_back"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.route": false, "navigation.cell": [160, 135]}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_back"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.route": true}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_minimize"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.mini": true, "navi_window.size": [134.0, 61.0], "navi_window.position": [376.0, 215.0]}, "windows_open": ["Navigation"]}},
    {"move": [1000, 740]},
    {"shot": "navi-small-form", "crop": [366, 205, 160, 80], "threshold": 2},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_maximize"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.mini": false, "navi_window.route": true}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_auto"}},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.auto_mini": true, "navi_window.mini": false}}},
    {"click_on": {"cell": [164, 118]}},
    {"wait_for": {"sent": "0x035f", "ms": 3000}},
    {"wait": 800},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.mini": true, "navigation.cell": [160, 135]}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_close"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_open": ["PartyAsked", "Navigation"]}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "ok"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navigation": null, "navi_window.route": false}, "windows_open": ["Navigation"]}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_close"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_closed": ["Navigation"]}}
  ]
}
